          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bamunyinabo abena Levi balisontelwe ukubomba imilimo imbi iyalekana lekana iya mwi Tenti lyakwa Lesa, ekutila mu ŋanda yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.6.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.6.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 6:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Aroni na bana bakwe bena ebaletuula imituulo pa bulambo bwakocelapo amalambo elyo na pa bulambo bwakocelapo ububani, mu milimo yonse iyalecitika mu muputule wamushilo icine cine, no kufutilako abena Israeli pa fyabubifi ukulingana na fyonse ifyo Mose umubomfi wakwa Lesa akonkomeshe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.6.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.6.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
